EXT. CLING VILLAGE SQUARE — MORNING #0A#

[[ONSCREEN: CLING]]

The square before the festival. The vendor sets out his crate at the stall; the musician tunes his lute on the fountain rim.

VENDOR
(calling across)
You're early.

MUSICIAN
The crowd won't wait.

VENDOR
(dry)
